{"abstract":"The grand challenge in Digital Transformation is the implementation of fundamental changes in the way we carry out our business. In this paper we present a case of digital transformation implementing a customer-centric solution in a medium-sized European financial tech-company servicing eight medium-sized and smaller banks. From an analysis of the case, we elicit four design principles for Digital Transformation. We call them the strategizing principle, the showcasing principle, the digital mindfulness and the scaling principle. Finally, we discuss the four design principles in a description of how other organizations can use the principles to achieve digital transformation success.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Nielsen, Ann Dorte F."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-820907"],"event":{"end":"2025-06-04","place":"Montego Bay, jm","start":"2025-06-02","title":"20th International Conference on Design Science Research in Information Systems and Technology, DESRIST 2025","year":"2025"},"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Customer centric Solution","Design principles","Design science research","Digital transformation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a successful finance sector case of digital transformation eliciting four design principles","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-820907","identifier":[{"id":"105008228438","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-db6136af-2a13-4421-b535-2d64f404e69b"],"keyword":["Customer-centric Solution","Design Principles","Design Science Research","Digital Transformation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-1D96A5BC76F34D27C6E844E6A743FA4C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Danske Bank"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Ann Dorte F.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Ann Dorte F.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Samir","key":"chatterjeepedh","last":"Chatterjee","name":"Chatterjee, Samir","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"vombrockepedh","last":"vom Brocke","name":"vom Brocke, Jan","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ricardo","key":"andersonpedh","last":"Anderson","name":"Anderson, Ricardo","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-031-93979-2_12","eisbn":["9783031939792"],"isbn":["9783031939785"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"162-176","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"20th International Conference on Design Science Research in Information Systems and Technology, DESRIST 2025, Proceedings, Part II","title":"Local Solutions for Global Challenges"},"review":"Peer Reviewed",