{"abstract":"Motivating sustainable behavioral change remains a challenge for researchers, policymakers, and organizations. This paper aims to understand and conceptualize behavioral change in households, as their daily decisions and behaviors significantly impact resource consumption and the environment. Drawing on existing literature supported by data from a serious game intervention, we identify four pathways to sustainable behavioral change: integrating with existing practices, pursuing goals, adopting new practices, and navigating household transitions. We emphasize the distinction between sustainability practices and pathway practices, highlighting the latter's crucial role. Based on an understanding of household practices and family interactions in the areas of food consumption, energy conservation, procurement, and waste management, we identify eight pathway practices that constitute the processes involved in making subtle changes in everyday sustainable behavior. We contribute to IS literature with a conceptual framework that can aid in designing interventions, particularly serious game interventions, to support household processes toward behavioral change.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Boulus-Rødje, Nina","Kure, Caroline Louise Willer","Madsen, Sabine","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-801340"],"event":{"end":"2024-12-18","place":"Bangkok, th","start":"2024-12-15","title":"45th International Conference on Information Systems","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Green IS","Pathways","Practice theory","Serious games","Sustainability"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"becoming sustainable through pathway practices and serious games a household perspective","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-801340","identifier":[{"id":"105010827777","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-482f0198-b0d6-4815-9599-cdcc05aba0be"],"keyword":["Green IS","Pathways","Practice theory","Serious Games","Sustainability"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-434EF70C43336A1D4E0DE4D91E97A24E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Nina","key":"boulusrødjepau","last":"Boulus-Rødje","locid":"eb7b15a4-1bca-48da-9fe7-039040ba3f4d","name":"Boulus-Rødje, Nina","orcid":"0000-0002-0837-0853","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Caroline Louise Willer","key":"kurepau","last":"Kure","locid":"e28ca0e7-8aef-4e07-8d63-62673100179a","name":"Kure, Caroline Louise Willer","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Sabine","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"e2dbef6b-64bd-4e3f-a135-d4d21ec079da","name":"Madsen, Sabine","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-482f0198-b0d6-4815-9599-cdcc05aba0be"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Becoming Sustainable Through Pathway Practices and Serious Games : A Household Perspective","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801340","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-801291"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evalueringer af rigsrevisionens beretninger fra 000000002023 af professor jan pries heje","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/108748085/Evaluering_af_Rigsrevisionens_beretninger_for_2023_-_fra_Jan_Pries-Heje.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-801291","ids":["ruc-1571fa22-f198-42c3-b8dc-16d2e56a438e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E804FE5CA72173CDD8A31B34FF13F121"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/108748085/Evaluering_af_Rigsrevisionens_beretninger_for_2023_-_fra_Jan_Pries-Heje.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-1571fa22-f198-42c3-b8dc-16d2e56a438e"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Evalueringer af Rigsrevisionens beretninger fra 2023 af Professor Jan Pries-Heje","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801291","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Using action research methodology in a clinical mode, we apply agile techniques to the strategy-making activities of two government organizations. These organizations faced immediate needs for better digitalization strategies. We modularized their strategy into four modules and constructed an original strategy using agile practices and principles. The results showed that agile management of strategy may involve iteration with agile management practices that will execute the strategy. Also, those new to agile strategy management may need careful preparation and training to construct their teams. Team members may also need the backing of a peer network to succeed. Further, agile management of strategy is a promising management advance for organizations in unstable and disruptive environments; plus it further provides a strategy-making alternative for managers who must cope with digitalization among their partners. Overall, agile strategy management offers organizations the possibility to achieve a higher level of agility","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Baskerville, Richard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-801460"],"event":{"end":"2024-12-18","place":"Bangkok, th","start":"2024-12-15","title":"45th International Conference on Information Systems","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia State University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"agile management of digitalization strategy","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-801460","ids":["ruc-a845624f-9646-4ef9-bb47-81012f643de9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C61C7116DA0C8265366C8479950CC734"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Richard","key":"baskervillepau","last":"Baskerville","name":"Baskerville, Richard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-a845624f-9646-4ef9-bb47-81012f643de9"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Agile Management of Digitalization Strategy","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801460","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Using action research methodology in a clinical mode, we apply agile techniques to the strategy-making activities of a government organization. This organization faces immediate needs for better digitalization strategies. We modularized their strategy into four modules and constructed an original strategy using five agile-inspired sprints. The results showed that agile management of strategy requires iteration with agile management practices that will execute the strategy. Also, those new to agile strategy management need careful preparation and training to construct their teams. Team members also need the backing of a peer network to succeed. Further, agile management of strategy is a promising management advance for organizations in unstable and disruptive environments; and also an attractive strategy-making alternative for managers who must cope with digitalization among their partners. Overall, it offers organizations the possibility for a higher level of agility","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Baskerville, Richard L."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-801522"],"event":{"end":"2024-03-16","place":"Gulf Shores, us","start":"2024-03-15","title":"26th Annual meeting of Southern Association of Information Systems (SAIS)","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia State University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"agile management of strategy","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/sais2024/34/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-801522","ids":["ruc-e5e423ec-640f-48a8-98bc-8a750c02738b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6729D2D7C2D13B83D5983AE13F0C8ABA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/sais2024/34/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Richard L.","key":"baskervillepau","last":"Baskerville","name":"Baskerville, Richard L.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"AIS Association","status":"p","title":"26th Proceedings of the Southern Association for Information Systems Conference"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-e5e423ec-640f-48a8-98bc-8a750c02738b"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Agile Management of Strategy","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801522","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Our study explored how generative AI, exemplified by ChatGPT and Large Language Models (LLMs), is reshaping the landscape of Information Systems Project Management (ISPM).","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Cranefield, Jocelyn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-801524"],"event":{"end":"2024-12-18","place":"Bangkok, th","start":"2024-12-15","title":"45th International Conference on Information Systems","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["New Zealand"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Victoria University of Wellington"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how generative ai is altering the nature of information systems project management","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/treos_icis2024/33/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-801524","ids":["ruc-e98faa6e-9d96-4505-b2e8-36afa4eb2506"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9EE958FE4E516B77329F8624087D7706"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/108747847/ICIS-2024-TREO-talk-On-IS-Project-Mgmt-and-ChatGPT_-submitted.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/treos_icis2024/33/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nz","key":"victoria university of wellington","loc":["New Zealand","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Victoria University of Wellington","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jocelyn","key":"cranefieldpau","last":"Cranefield","name":"Cranefield, Jocelyn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-e98faa6e-9d96-4505-b2e8-36afa4eb2506"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"How generative AI is altering the nature of Information Systems Project Management","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-801524","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"People with HIV (PWH) and people with diabetes mellitus have increased risk of severe COVID-19, but little is known about humoral response to COVID-19 vaccines in PWH with DM. We investigated SARS-CoV-2 antireceptor-binding domain (anti-RBD) immunoglobulin G (IgG) geometrical concentrations and neutralizing antibody capacity (nAB) in PWH with and without diabetes mellitus. Anti-RBD IgG and nAB in COVID-19-vaccinated PWH were not associated with diabetes mellitus-status or HbA1c 24 months after the initial COVID-19 vaccination.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Bering, Louise","Heftdal, Line Dam","Heidari, Safura Luise","Hamm, Sebastian Rask","Hansen, Cecillie Bo","Møller, Dina Leth","Pries-Heje, Mia","Fogh, Kamille","Hasselbalch, Rasmus Bo","Pérez-Alós, Laura","Gerstoft, Jan","Benfield, Thomas","Berg, Selina Kikkenborg","Christensen, Anne Vinggaard","Birk, Nina Marie","Hilsted, Linda Maria","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Frikke-Schmidt, Ruth","Sørensen, Erik","Grønbæk, Kirsten","Bundgaard, Henning","Iversen, Kasper","Garred, Peter","Nielsen, Susanne Dam"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-791056"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"humoral response 000000000024 months after the first covid 000000000019 vaccination in people with hiv with and without diabetes","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-791056","identifier":[{"id":"85213870234","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39715497","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-d5e15d13-ad58-423f-aa67-666c87bd44e3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AC87B4732A0638A3A0BD35D48DBE9878"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country"