 Sven-Volker","rank":60,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 56 57","first":"Samuel","key":"ribeironavarretesamuelpau","last":"Ribeiro-Navarrete","name":"Ribeiro-Navarrete, Samuel","rank":61,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 58","first":"Alexander","key":"richteralexanderpau","last":"Richter","name":"Richter, Alexander","rank":62,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 47 59","first":"Frantz","key":"rowefrantzpau","last":"Rowe","name":"Rowe, Frantz","rank":63,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 60","first":"Suprateek","key":"sarkersuprateekpau","last":"Sarker","name":"Sarker, Suprateek","rank":64,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 61","first":"Bernd Carsten","key":"stahlberndcarstenpau","last":"Stahl","name":"Stahl, Bernd Carsten","rank":65,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 48","first":"Manoj Kumar","key":"tiwarimanojkumarpau","last":"Tiwari","name":"Tiwari, Manoj Kumar","rank":66,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 62","first":"Wil","key":"vanderaalstwilpau","last":"van der Aalst","name":"van der Aalst, Wil","rank":67,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 63","first":"Viswanath","key":"venkateshviswanathpau","last":"Venkatesh","name":"Venkatesh, Viswanath","rank":68,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 64 65","first":"Giampaolo","key":"vigliagiampaolopau","last":"Viglia","name":"Viglia, Giampaolo","rank":69,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 66","first":"Michael","key":"wademichaelpau","last":"Wade","name":"Wade, Michael","rank":70,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 67","first":"Paul","key":"waltonpaulpau","last":"Walton","name":"Walton, Paul","rank":71,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 68","first":"Jochen","key":"wirtzjochenpau","last":"Wirtz","name":"Wirtz, Jochen","rank":72,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"10 60","first":"Ryan","key":"wrightryanpau","last":"Wright","name":"Wright, Ryan","rank":73,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijinfomgt.2023.102642","issn":["14614111","17415179"],"issn_org":["14614111"],"issue":"102642","journal":"International Journal of Information Technology and Management","paperid":"102642","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Information Technology and Management","volume":"71"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85149886538"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-42070307-be39-483b-9b46-a05a7f4eaff5"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"“So what if ChatGPT wrote it?” : Multidisciplinary perspectives on opportunities, challenges and implications of generative conversational AI for research, practice and policy","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560418","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"For this paper, we have identified a list of 32 characteristic symptoms that is often discussed during assessments, generated by two experienced assessors who had undertaken maturity assessments in more than 300 companies. We then use cognitive mapping and the “five whys” technique to look beyond the symptoms and reveal the underlying problems or causes of the problems. Following that, we evaluate our findings through the design and evaluation of a web-based tool where users can score statements based on a formulation of the symptoms. This enables us to recommend to users the areas where they probably need to improve. We designed the tool in three learning cycles of design evaluation and ended up in a summative evaluation where we compared the outcome of using the website tool with a CMMI maturity assessment. We conclude that a systematic quest for symptoms coupled with scoring statements based on the symptoms can point to improvement areas. However, we conclude that doing so is no substitute for a maturity assessment; the scoring of statements cannot reveal the maturity of the organization, but it can quickly and easily point in a useful direction and provide recommendations for going in that direction.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Johansen, Jørn","Korsaa, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-563169"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CMMI","Cognitive map","Improvement","Maturity","Process improvement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"symptom based improvement recommendations","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/79727831/20210630_A_Cognitive_map_of_Maturity_without_changes_shown.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-563169","identifier":[{"id":"85114253679","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-6bbff03a-2984-4c27-8a6d-3b3c965a2019"],"keyword":["CMMI","cognitive map","improvement","maturity","process improvement"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DDB9A818CCF92CF9DB9667150C98C67B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/79727831/20210630_A_Cognitive_map_of_Maturity_without_changes_shown.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Whitebox"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jørn","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","name":"Johansen, Jørn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Morten","key":"korsaapau","last":"Korsaa","name":"Korsaa, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/smr.2375","issn":["20477473","20477481"],"issn_org":["20477481"],"issue":"8","journal":"Journal of Software: Evolution and Process","paperid":"e2375","status":"p","title":"Journal of Software: Evolution and Process","volume":"35"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85114253679"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","whitebox"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-6bbff03a-2984-4c27-8a6d-3b3c965a2019"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Symptom-based improvement recommendations","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-563169","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: We investigated long-term durability of humoral and cellular immune responses to third dose of BNT162b2 in people with HIV (PWH) and controls. Methods: In 378 PWH with undetectable viral replication and 224 matched controls vaccinated with three doses of BNT162b2, we measured IgG-antibodies against the receptor binding domain of SARS-CoV-2 spike protein three months before third dose of BNT162b2, and four and eleven months after. In 178 PWH and 135 controls, the cellular response was assessed by interferon-γ (IFN-γ) release in whole blood four months after third dose. Differences in antibody or IFN-γ concentrations were assessed by uni- and multivariable linear regressions. Findings: Before the third dose the concentration of SARS-CoV-2 antibodies was lower in PWH than in controls (unadjusted geometric mean ratio (GMR): 0.68 (95% CI: 0.54–0.86, p = 0.002). We observed no differences in antibody concentrations between PWH and controls after four (0.90 (95% CI: 0.75–1.09), p = 0.285) or eleven months (0.89 (95% CI: 0.69–1.14), p = 0.346) after the third dose. We found no difference in IFN-γ concentrations four months after the third dose between PWH and controls (1.06 (95% CI: 0.71–1.60), p = 0.767). Interpretation: We found no differences in antibody concentrations or cellular response between PWH and controls up to eleven months after third dose of BNT162b2. Our findings indicate that PWH with undetectable viral replication and controls have comparable immune responses to three doses of the BNT162b2 vaccine. Funding: This work was funded by the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NFF205A0063505, NNF20SA0064201), the Carlsberg Foundation (CF20-476 0045), the Svend Andersen Research Foundation (SARF2021), and Bio- and Genome Bank Denmark.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Heftdal, Line Dam","Pérez-Alós, Laura","Hasselbalch, Rasmus Bo","Hansen, Cecilie Bo","Hamm, Sebastian Rask","Møller, Dina Leth","Pries-Heje, Mia","Fogh, Kamille","Gerstoft, Jan","Grønbæk, Kirsten","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Frikke-Schmidt, Ruth","Sørensen, Erik","Hilsted, Linda","Bundgaard, Henning","Garred, Peter","Iversen, Kasper","Sabin, Caroline","Nielsen, Susanne Dam"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-684208"],"filters":{"added":"2023-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","National Institute for Health Research","University College London"],"keyword":["BNT162b2","Booster dose","HIV","Immune response","SARS CoV 2"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"humoral and cellular immune responses eleven months after the third dose of bnt000000000162b000000000002 an mrna based covid 000000000019 vaccine in people with hiv a prospective observational cohort study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ebiom.2023.104661","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-684208","identifier":[{"id":"37331161","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85162027082","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10272831","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-8815ba61-41c6-4b37-968d-af5e809a94a7"],"keyword":["BNT162b2","Booster dose","HIV","Immune response","SARS-CoV-2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-22CB944BDC99165E4404EAF79AE18170"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/360403393/1_s2.0_S2352396423002268_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ebiom.2023.104661","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku uni