{"abstract":"Design knowledge has been conceptualized as a resilient relationship between problem and solution spaces. In innovative product development, though, the problem space is unknown at worst or ambiguous at best and it can be difficult move design knowledge into the solution space. We pursue solutions for this by combining short, intensive design undertakings called “design sprints” with the method of “lead users”. We show how formalized design principles from the lead user method and the design sprint method can be extracted, defined, and executed on by applying them to a case setting of climate solutions as innovations. We contribute with both knowledge on the problem as well as on the potential solution through a hexagonal map in a way that aids designers to better understand the resilient relationship between problem and solution spaces. We further contribute to theoretical knowledge by showing how researchers can make transparent the inferences from problem space to solution space.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-569842"],"event":{"end":"2022-08-17","place":"Helsinge, dk","start":"2022-08-14","title":"13th Scandinavian Conference on Information Systems 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lead users and design sprints building relations between spaces in product development","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/83494232/SCIS2022_LeadUsersDesignSprints_camera_ready_v1.2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-569842","ids":["ruc-ce859921-a295-4293-ac49-5554f9c95f35"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-76C1E5D7045A5A8CC977CE2A39347914"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/83494232/SCIS2022_LeadUsersDesignSprints_camera_ready_v1.2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Magnus Rotvit Perlt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d9c2134a-0799-45eb-8a15-e0523fc96da2","name":"Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-ce859921-a295-4293-ac49-5554f9c95f35"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Lead Users and Design Sprints : Building Relations Between Spaces in Product Development","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-569842","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Descriptive theories tell us how to understand the world better and prescriptive theories tell us how to make the world better. Design theories are of the latter kind but usually involves a product or process artifact to create changes as well. Despite a focus on utility, there is little evidence about how design theories become adopted after their development. We know too little about how design theories are applied, adopted, adapted, and emerge and change over time. We present a study of an organizational change design theory that was adopted in 108 different organizations. The results indicate that the theory was adopted As-Is in 25% of the cases. But it was adapted in various ways for use in the remaining organizations. Our analysis of these cases provides a typology of eight categories of adoptability. Among these, organizations most commonly adapted the recommended organizational strategy. As a result of these and other findings we show how design theory adoption is a continuous co-creation process between design theorists and design adopters.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Baskervillle, Richard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-569929"],"event":{"end":"2022-06-16","place":"Maynooth, ie","start":"2022-06-15","title":"IFIP WG 8.6 International Working Conference on Transfer and Diffusion of IT, TDIT 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia State University"],"keyword":["Design logic","Design theory","IT adoption","Organizational change"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"co design theory adoptability how organizational change is co created by design theorists and theory adopters","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/88561207/Design_Theory_Adoptability_FINAL_20220425_sendt_til_proceedings_af_Dick.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-569929","identifier":[{"id":"85140800189","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-cfafd12b-5a83-4f0f-9042-2d7d08a7042a"],"keyword":["Design logic","Design theory","IT adoption","Organizational change"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BF573402EE34E9A2BDCD48DA2FA633EB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/88561207/Design_Theory_Adoptability_FINAL_20220425_sendt_til_proceedings_af_Dick.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Richard","key":"baskervilllepau","last":"Baskervillle","name":"Baskervillle, Richard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Amany","key":"elbannapedh","last":"Elbanna","name":"Elbanna, Amany","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Shane","key":"mcloughlinpedh","last":"McLoughlin","name":"McLoughlin, Shane","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Yogesh K.","key":"dwivedipedh","last":"Dwivedi","name":"Dwivedi, Yogesh K.","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Brian","key":"donnellanpedh","last":"Donnellan","name":"Donnellan, Brian","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"David","key":"wastellpedh","last":"Wastell","name":"Wastell, David","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-031-17968-6_2","isbn":["9783031179679"],"issn":["18684238"],"pages":"24-39","publisher":"Springer","series":"IFIP Advances in Information and Communication Technology","status":"p","title":"Co-creating for Context in the Transfer and Diffusion of IT - IFIP WG 8.6 International Working Conference on Transfer and Diffusion of IT, TDIT 2022, Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85140800189"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-cfafd12b-5a83-4f0f-9042-2d7d08a7042a"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Co-design Theory Adoptability : How Organizational Change is Co-created by Design Theorists and Theory Adopters","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-569929","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Jan Pries-Heje Evaluering af beretningerne 20/2020 Skatteministeriets it-beredskab 1/2021 Politiets patruljering og overvågning 6/2021 Økonomi i Skatteministeriets udvikling af nyt ejendomsvurderingssystem Tværgående pointer fra de skriftlige evalueringer af beretningerne fra 2021","author_count":1,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-572858"],"filters":{"added":"2022-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evaluering af rigsrevisionens beretninger","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/80616394/Faglig_evaluering_2021_Jan_Pries_Heje.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-572858","ids":["ruc-fa752d20-6db4-4fed-9234-721bf7977fe8"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1749FC5BF5F0D395ED05474E40279336"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/80616394/Faglig_evaluering_2021_Jan_Pries_Heje.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-fa752d20-6db4-4fed-9234-721bf7977fe8"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Evaluering af Rigsrevisionens beretninger","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-572858","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background: People with HIV (PWH) are at increased risk of severe COVID-19. We aimed to determine humoral responses in PWH and controls who received two doses of BNT162b2. Methods: In 269 PWH and 538 age-matched controls, we measured IgG and neutralizing antibodies specific for the receptor-binding domain of SARS-CoV-2 at baseline, 3 weeks and 2 months after the first dose of BNT162b2. Results: IgG antibodies increased from baseline to 3 weeks and from 3 weeks to 2 months in both groups, but the concentrations of IgG antibodies were lower in PWH than that in controls at 3 weeks and 2 months (p = 0.025 and <0.001), respectively. The IgG titres in PWH with a humoral response at 2 months were 77.9% (95% confidence interval [62.5%–97.0%], age- and sex-adjusted p = 0.027) of controls. Conclusions: Reduced IgG antibody response to vaccination with BNT162b2 was found in PWH, and thus increased awareness of breakthrough infections in PWH is needed.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Heftdal, Line Dam","Knudsen, Andreas D.","Hamm, Sebastian Rask","Hansen, Cecilie Bo","Møller, Dina Leth","Pries-Heje, Mia","Fogh, Kamille","Hasselbalch, Rasmus Bo","Jarlhelt, Ida","Pérez-Alós, Laura","Hilsted, Linda Maria","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Gerstoft, Jan","Grønbæk, Kirsten","Bundgaard, Henning","Iversen, Kasper","Garred, Peter","Nielsen, Susanne Dam"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-412818"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antibody response","BNT162b2","HIV","SARS CoV 2","Vaccine"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"humoral response to two doses of bnt000000000162b000000000002 vaccination in people with hiv","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/305538681/LINI_joim.13419.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-412818","identifier":[{"id":"PMC9011842","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"34841629","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85121385903","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-20879e9c-7967-4c3f-8090-38e3326115e5"],"keyword":["BNT162b2","HIV","SARS-CoV-2","antibody response","vaccine"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8D8022593E42FFC8BE0A8112C33DD524"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/305538681/LINI_joim.13419.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Line Dam","key":"heftdalpau","last":"Heftdal","name":"Heftdal, Line Dam","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Andreas Dehlbæk","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"fbeb64c3-4995-4397-8457-b4c20c93dc7a","name":"Knudsen, Andreas D.","name_org":"Knudsen, Andreas Dehlbæk","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Sebastian Rask","key":"hammpau","last":"Hamm","locid":"fda23bba-aa98-4ad7-97