{"abstract":"Classic maturity models require one or more trained assessors interacting with interviewees from the organization. This is a very rigorous and therefore costly process. In this paper we have developed the opposite; a relevant-focused and problem-based approach that can be used to generate improvement advice. We start out from the observation that trained assessors often observe symptoms when they enter an organization and find that there is an intuitive correlation with the given recommendations. We then developed a framework of symptoms and underlying problems using a technique called cognitive mapping. This framework was then used in a large organization to derive recommendations based on symptoms. This proof-of-concept seemed to work quite well. We present our framework and discuss how it can be implemented as an online tool. Further we identify several ways our approach can be further researched.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Johansen, Jørn","Korsaa, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-566275"],"event":{"end":"2021-09-03","place":"Krems, at","start":"2021-09-01","title":"28th European Conference on Systems, Software and Services Process Improvement, EuroSPI 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CMMI","Cognitive map","Improvement","Maturity","Process improvement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"symptom based improvement advice a new relevant focused problem based framework","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-566275","identifier":[{"id":"85115066732","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-98717c4d-4d0c-4304-89cd-9187d5890a50"],"keyword":["CMMI","Cognitive map","Improvement","Maturity","Process Improvement"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B28D45E896A7586B0B4E9FDD7243D72E"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Whitebox"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jørn","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","name":"Johansen, Jørn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Morten","key":"korsaapau","last":"Korsaa","name":"Korsaa, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Murat","key":"yilmazpedh","last":"Yilmaz","name":"Yilmaz, Murat","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Paul","key":"clarkepedh","last":"Clarke","name":"Clarke, Paul","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Richard","key":"messnarzpedh","last":"Messnarz","name":"Messnarz, Richard","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"reinerpedh","last":"Reiner","name":"Reiner, Michael","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-85521-5_10","isbn":["9783030855208"],"issn":["18650929"],"pages":"139-150","publisher":"Springer","series":"Communications in Computer and Information Science","status":"p","title":"Systems, Software and Services Process Improvement - 28th European Conference, EuroSPI 2021, Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85115066732"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","whitebox"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-98717c4d-4d0c-4304-89cd-9187d5890a50"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Symptom-Based Improvement Advice : A New Relevant-Focused Problem-Based Framework","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-566275","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"One of the biggest IT-projects in Denmark the last five years is the implementation of theHealthcare platform for2.5million peopleathospitals East of The Great Belt, counting Zealand, Bornholm, and the capital, Copenhagen. Thousands of doctors and nurses have had to change their work practices. The implementation caused a lot of discussion to whether the project was a success or not? Also,a Facebookgroup against the platform was created. Based on a longitudinal interview study with key stakeholders and a multi-view analysis of more than 6000 Facebookpostingswe answer the research question: How are IT project success and resistance to change related? Bydeveloping a typology of resistance that we can relate to typologies of IT-project successwe show that IT-project success and resistance to change are intertwined in many ways. In other words, if you want projectsuccessand stakeholder satisfactionyou need to cope with different types of resistance.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Fleron, Benedicte","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-567850"],"event":{"end":"2021-08-11","place":"Trondheim, no","start":"2021-08-09","title":"12th Scandinavian Conference on Information Systems","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"success and resistance to change in it projects a case study of a large healthcare it project","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-567850","ids":["ruc-b0b71630-205d-4a15-809a-7444601546e5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B6B470888C810B4437A8E6856EE6101F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Benedicte","key":"fleronpau","last":"Fleron","locid":"1eac1461-da4c-47d8-9661-106a1a39ae9f","name":"Fleron, Benedicte","orcid":"0009-0002-6000-9923","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-b0b71630-205d-4a15-809a-7444601546e5"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Success and Resistance to Change in IT-Projects : A Case Study of a Large Healthcare IT Project","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-567850","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Projektet om Sundhedsplatformen viser, hvor flygtigt succes-begrebet er i forbindelse med store it-projekter. Vi har lavet et studie, der viser, at projektets interessenter har helt forskellige opfattelser af Sundhedsplatformen, der spænder fra at være en stor succes, til at det var den største fiasko i mands minde. Det skriver Jan Pries-Heje og & Benedicte Fleron, der er henholdsvis professor og adjunkt i Informatik ved Roskilde Universitet.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Fleron, Benedicte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-563432"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"implementering af store it projekter i det offentlige hvad kan man gøre for at få succes","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://pro.ing.dk/digitech/article/implementering-af-store-it-projekter-i-det-offentlige-hvad-kan-man-goere-faa","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-563432","ids":["ruc-6f6cbfe0-9bc0-48fe-8af2-cf3094c372d2"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CBE2728DB2B63794ED9CA96F9E29C1E4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Benedicte","key":"fleronpau","last":"Fleron","locid":"1eac1461-da4c-47d8-9661-106a1a39ae9f","name":"Fleron, Benedicte","orcid":"0009-0002-6000-9923","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01056220"],"newspaper":"Ingenioeren","status":"p","title":"Ingenioeren"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-6f6cbfe0-9bc0-48fe-8af2-cf3094c372d2"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Implementering af store IT-projekter i det offentlige : Hvad kan man gøre for at få succes?","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-563432","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This chapter consists of several sections which contain contributions from members of IFIP Technical Committee 8 (Information Systems). We highlight the accomplishments of Technical Committee 8 (TC8) and its working groups over its 50 years history, and then envisage possible strategies for the future of information systems (IS) in a post-COVID world. This chapter begins with an overall view of the diverse and changing roles of the IS field then moves forward to foresee environmental sustainability and digital glocalization in a post-COVID-19 world. Next, we review the achievements of TC8, the establishment of the working groups within it, and predict what TC8 has to offer into the future. Lastly, we identify the individual working groups of TC8 to detail their activities as important conduits of research and practice in the field of IS over the past 50 years, then imagine the roles of the TC8 working groups in a post-COVID landscape.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Ramos, Isabel","Mackrell, Dale","van der Merwe, Alta","Pries-Heje, Jan","Ralyté, Jolita","Stirna, Janis","Krogstie, John","Jones, Matthew","Mueller, Benjamin","Adam, Frédéric","Jaber, Bettina","Weippl, Edgar","Janssen, Marijn","Elbanna, Amany","Lal, Banita","Plebani, Pierluigi","Johnston, Allen C.","Da Xu, Li"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-562529"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa","America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Ireland","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Portugal","South Africa","Sweden","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Culverhouse College of Business","Delft University of Technology","Griffith University","Judge Institute of Management Studies","Norwegian University of Science and Technology","Old Dominion University","Polytechnic University of Milan","School of Business and Management","Stockholm University","University College Cork","University of Bradford","University of Geneva","University of Minho","University of Pretoria","Université de Lausanne","Vienna University of Technology"],"keyword":["Information systems","Organisations","Society","Technical Committee 8","Technology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the future of information systems in a post covid world by tc000000000008 information systems","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-562529","identifier":[{"id":"85112585078","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-628d03e2-da55-4c62-90eb-fea9ebef3390"],"keyword":["Information systems","Organisations","Society","Technical Committee 8","Technology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D2342464821EA4EFD0D43A0E6388A9CE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"pt","key":"university of minho","loc":["Portugal","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Minho","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"griffith university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Griffith University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"za","key":"university of pretoria","loc":["South Africa","Africa"],"name":"University of Pretoria","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"ch","key":"university of geneva","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Geneva","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"se","key":"stockholm university","l