{"abstract":"This working paper gives an account of the development of a first prototype of an App to be used by households to control their appliances thereby using available regenerative energy in a more efficient way. We give an account of different types of prototyping and why we choose to carry out a design sprint. We tell how and why we did what we did in the Design Sprint in June 2020. We present process and product design learning outcomes. And finally we show a picture gallery from the process as well as illustrations from the prototype.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","Pries-Heje, Jan","Tchatchoua, Nadine Sandjo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-570888"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design sprint week evaluation","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/75526943/RUC_Working_Paper_Design_sprint_week_evaluation.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-570888","ids":["ruc-dd6aac3d-c1ce-4540-b972-295b554b1014"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-8E4913CB2723332C939901ABA4F632FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/75526943/RUC_Working_Paper_Design_sprint_week_evaluation.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Magnus Rotvit Perlt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d9c2134a-0799-45eb-8a15-e0523fc96da2","name":"Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Nadine Sandjo","key":"tchatchouapau","last":"Tchatchoua","locid":"00d16de9-68e1-4fbb-95c4-4198b1dde7f0","name":"Tchatchoua, Nadine Sandjo","orcid":"0000-0001-5638-147X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"16","place":"Roskilde","publisher":"Roskilde Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-dd6aac3d-c1ce-4540-b972-295b554b1014"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Design sprint week evaluation","type":"Working Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-570888","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"In a major IT development organization, individuals were too often working alone and sub-optimizing. Their performance was not anywhere near the desired level. Analysis indicated that this was due to a number of common factors which lacked attention. To address this, a framework with eight factors grounded in cross-disciplinary theory was developed and evaluated in the organization. It emerged that a self-assessment approach to the eight factors, coupled with training in team theory and facilitated workshops can provide significant value. In the paper, we present the overall framework and details of how to apply it. Furthermore, we present relevant examples and lessons learned. We conclude that you can “bootstrap” yourself to become a higher performing team through facilitated self-assessments using the eight factors.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Pedersen, Morten Bjerregaard","Pries-Heje, Jan","Stybe, Gita","Johansen, Jørn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-572611"],"event":{"acronym":"EuroSPI","end":"2019-09-20","place":"Edinburgh, gb","start":"2019-09-18","title":"26th European Conference on Systems, Software and Services Process Improvement","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Agile development","Case study","Framework","Self Assessment"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bootstrapping your team for higher performance","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/75243715/Pries_Heje_Bootstrapping_your_software_team_002_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-572611","identifier":[{"id":"85072992118","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-f6e6119c-e345-4a5b-85a2-45f348efa527"],"keyword":["Agile development","Case study","Framework","High performing teams","Self-assessment"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F41A3D5E0F4CAD3C46853206778D8372"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/75243715/Pries_Heje_Bootstrapping_your_software_team_002_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Danske Bank"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Morten Bjerregaard","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Morten Bjerregaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Gita","key":"stybepau","last":"Stybe","name":"Stybe, Gita","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jørn","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","name":"Johansen, Jørn","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Alastair","key":"walkerpedh","last":"Walker","name":"Walker, Alastair","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Rory V.","key":"oconnorpedh","last":"O’Connor","name":"O’Connor, Rory V.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Richard","key":"messnarzpedh","last":"Messnarz","name":"Messnarz, Richard","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-28005-5_13","eisbn":["9783030280055"],"isbn":["9783030280048"],"issn":["18650929"],"issue":"1060","pages":"163-178","place":"Switzerland","publisher":"Springer","series":"Communications in Computer and Information Science","status":"p","subtitle":"26th European Conference, EuroSPI 2019, Edinburgh, UK, September 18-20, 2019 Proceedings","title":"Systems, Software and Services Process Improvement"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85072992118"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","danske bank","whitebox"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-f6e6119c-e345-4a5b-85a2-45f348efa527"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Bootstrapping Your Team for Higher Performance","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-572611","year":"2019","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"A Fata Morgana is a far-sight vision that disappears when you get closer. In a case study of a large healthcare system we find the notion of success to have the same characteristics as a fata morgana. We present the case and give an account of how it can be considered a project success. We then bring in the public opinion as seen through newspaper stories about the same case – and the success disappears again. This is important because we can use this dichotomy to identify coping strategies one can use as project owner and/or project manager to define and ensure that the project will be perceived as a success. We conclude the paper by summing up the coping strategies identified in a resulting framework.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Fleron, Benedicte","Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-560425"],"event":{"end":"2019-08-14","place":"Nokia, fi","start":"2019-08-11","title":"10th Scandinavian Conference on Information Systems","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"is success in it projects a fata morgana a case study of a large healthcare it project","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-560425","ids":["ruc-4213fe21-f457-496a-89b8-42e25e610b1a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-86546E4CF6CE0843DF8986FA78987DDE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Sustainable Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Benedicte","key":"fleronpau","last":"Fleron","locid":"1eac1461-da4c-47d8-9661-106a1a39ae9f","name":"Fleron, Benedicte","orcid":"0009-0002-6000-9923","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Magnus Rotvit Perlt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d9c2134a-0799-45eb-8a15-e0523fc96da2","name":"Hansen, Magnus Rotvit Perlt","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-4213fe21-f457-496a-89b8-42e25e610b1a"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Is Success in IT Projects a Fata Morgana? : A Case Study of a Large Healthcare IT Project","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560425","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
