sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-561108","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"An interview study focusing on online collaboration in geographically distributed IT development teams in Danske Bank revealed seven problem areas. To cope with the problems the authors applied a design science research approach to construct a conceptual framework for improving online collaboration. The conceptual framework combines a six-phase teambuilding model with six elements of social capital. Thus, in each phase of teambuilding, the online collaborators aim at building up all six elements of social capital. The complete six-by-six framework was successfully tried and diffused throughout Danske Bank. This chapter gives an account of the framework content and the results from the evaluation.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Pries-Heje, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-561311"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improving online collaboration in contemporary it development teams","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.igi-global.com/book/online-collaboration-communication-contemporary-organizations/182671","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-561311","identifier":[{"id":"85046507188","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-4fad7443-feab-4f9a-aa57-9f657f520308"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-CCA48738C42D1233A104437A7CD7FD99"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejejanpau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lene","key":"prieshejelenepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Lene","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ditte","key":"kolbækdittepedh","last":"Kolbæk","name":"Kolbæk, Ditte","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4018/978-1-5225-4094-6.ch009","eisbn":["9781522540953"],"isbn":["9781522540946"],"pages":"160-178","publisher":"IGI global","status":"p","title":"Online Collaboration and Communication in Contemporary Organizations"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85046507188"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-4fad7443-feab-4f9a-aa57-9f657f520308"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Improving online collaboration in contemporary IT development teams","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-561311","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"I dette kapitel ser vi på den agile metodes indtog i projektledelse. Vi vil komme ind på udbredelsen, de mest populære metoder, hvad virksomheder får ud af at bruge agile metoder, hvordan virksomheder skalerer agilt, og hvor parate de er til at tage imod agile principper. Overordnet kan det ses, at næsten 2/3 af projektlederne bruger eller har brugt agile metoder – med stor variation på tværs af brancher. Den markant mest udbredte agile metode er Scrum, som bruges af ca. 51%. De primære effekter, som de agile metoder har, er bedre alignment mellem forretning og projekter, accelereret produktlevering og bedre håndtering af ændringer – altså ikke besparelser. Hvis vi ser på skalering fra projektniveau til organisationsniveau, så viser det sig, at Lean Management-principper er en meget anvendt tankegang – også i forhold til de mere gængse rammeværk såsom SAFe og Scrum-of-Scrums. Slutteligt viser det sig, at paratheden til Agil er varierende i både ledelses-, projektledelsesog projektdeltagerlagene.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Bucka-Lassen, Dirk Bredgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-564242"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"agile metoder","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.mannaz.com/da/konsulentydelser/program-og-projektledelse/projektlederundersoegelsen-2018/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-564242","ids":["ruc-7b287e52-a079-466d-b5d9-aaad7a8505d0"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4F8051E8CCE8BFF74DD1A8CBEF7D295A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.mannaz.com/da/konsulentydelser/program-og-projektledelse/projektlederundersoegelsen-2018/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Mannaz A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Dirk Bredgaard","key":"buckalassenpau","last":"Bucka-Lassen","name":"Bucka-Lassen, Dirk Bredgaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Dirk Bredgaard","key":"buckalassenpedh","last":"Bucka-Lassen","name":"Bucka-Lassen, Dirk Bredgaard","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mogens Frank","key":"mikkelsenpedh","last":"Mikkelsen","name":"Mikkelsen, Mogens Frank","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepedh","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Keld","key":"bødkerpedh","last":"Bødker","name":"Bødker, Keld","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"pages":"22-32","place":"Hørsholm","publisher":"Mannaz AS","publisher_org":"Mannaz A/S","status":"p","subtitle":"Projektlederundersøgelsen 2018","title":"Hvordan går det ProjektDanmark?"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","mannaz a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-7b287e52-a079-466d-b5d9-aaad7a8505d0"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Agile metoder","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-564242","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Ifølge de store projektledelsesorganisationer såsom IPMA og PMI® handler en central del af projektledelse om at bruge værktøjskassen. Et interessant spørgsmål er derfor: Bruges værktøjerne? Det korte svar er ”ja”, og det lidt længere svar er, at især værktøjer eller teknikker til risikoanalyse, business case, interessentanalyse, målhierarki og projekt charter er udbredte. Ligesom i 2014-undersøgelsen har vi også spurgt ind til, hvilke udfordringer projektlederne oplever. Det ser ud til, at udfordringerne generelt er blevet mindre, og nogle udfordringer er blevet relativt mindre betydningsfulde, mens andre er steget i betydning. Specielt projektkompleksitet er en udfordring, som fylder betydeligt mere i 2018 end i 2014, med et dramatisk hop fra en 8. plads til en 2. plads i 2018. Dette undersøger vi nærmere i det følgende kapitel.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Bødker, Keld","Bucka-Lassen, Dirk Bredgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-564563"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"metoder teknikker og udfordringer","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.mannaz.com/da/konsulentydelser/program-og-projektledelse/projektlederundersoegelsen-2018/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-564563","ids":["ruc-7fb2c73d-da4a-4614-a443-992f85a37012"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B8AB8896D8A2EA7154D4D2A2392B3F1D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.mannaz.com/da/konsulentydelser/program-og-projektledelse/projektlederundersoegelsen-2018/","version":"Published Versi