{"abstract":"This paper presents a soft project management paradigm approach based on participatory design to assuring values and benefits in public projects. For more than a decade, quality development in the Danish healthcare sector has been managed with an accreditation system known as the Danish Quality Model (DQM). In 2015, in an attempt to reduce “bureaucratic process requirements” and “focus on specific goals and results,” the Danish government decided to discontinue this system (The Danish Ministry of Health, 2015, p. 2). In this paper, we introduce a participatory design approach known as effects-driven IT development and suggest how this approach may form a cornerstone of project management in a new quality-assurance program for the Danish healthcare sector.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Simonsen, Jesper","Scheuer, John Damm"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-563986"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Accreditation","Effects driven IT development","Improvement","Participatory Design","quality development"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"accreditation and participatory design an effects driven road to quality development projects","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/63920886/Simonsen_Scheuer_2016.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-563986","ids":["ruc-77ab1825-fbee-4d40-8b4f-29c9fd7e9593"],"keyword":["Participatory design","accreditation","effects-driven IT development","improvement","quality development","soft project management","value and benefit realization management"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E4DC781EC92CAF76DD4C7C8C91B3E8B7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/63920886/Simonsen_Scheuer_2016.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"580c081f-6732-4194-8a2e-b2b519e1c41d","name":"Simonsen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-1864-7158","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"John Damm","key":"scheuerpau","last":"Scheuer","locid":"8e76bd10-35fb-4c67-900f-e0a61bf8c797","name":"Scheuer, John Damm","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepedh","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Per","key":"svejvigpedh","last":"Svejvig","name":"Svejvig, Per","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788778674845"],"pages":"11-31","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Roskilde Universitetsforlag","series":"Danish Project Management Research Conference","status":"p","title":"Project Management for Achieving Change"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-77ab1825-fbee-4d40-8b4f-29c9fd7e9593"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Accreditation and Participatory Design : An Effects-Driven Road to Quality Development Projects","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.0