","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"østfold university college","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Østfold University College","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejeped","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","first":"Judith","key":"molkadanielsenped","last":"Molka-Danielsen","name":"Molka-Danielsen, Judith","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"3","first":"Jacob","key":"nørbjergped","last":"Nørbjerg","name":"Nørbjerg, Jacob","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"4","first":"Harald","key":"holoneped","last":"Holone","name":"Holone, Harald","rank":4,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"issn":["18919863"],"issue":"5","place":"Trondheim","publisher":"TAPIR Akademisk Forlag","series":"IRIS: Selected Papers of the Information Systems Research Seminar in Scandinavia","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-39116cde-2b5d-4dc7-98c6-19df63aa611a"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"IRIS Selected Papers of the Information Systems Research Seminar in Scandinavia","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-559813","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Design Science Research (DSR) is a complex form of research that combines very heterogeneous activities requiring different skills. Information systems and technologies are complex entities that have more elaborate areas of risk to manage. Research to invent and evaluate new IT artefacts introduces new areas of risk As yet, there is little experience with managing risk in DSR or even identification of types of risks to be managed. This paper analyses DSR research activities and elaborates known principles and practices of risk management and applies them to DSR to develop a new framework (RMF4DSR) for identifying, assessing, prioritizing, and treating potential risks inherent to DSR. Potential users of the framework include experienced and novice DSR researchers. The framework classifies six potential risk areas and enumerates specific key risks within each area. It includes risk assessment and treatment models. The paper applies the framework to a recent DSR case study to provide initial evidence of its value and feasibility and further evaluates the RMF4DSR framework by asking researchers to apply it in a workshop and surveying the participants’ opinions about the utility of the framework","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Venable, John","Baskerville, Richard"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-038359"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Curtin University","Georgia State University"],"keyword":["Design science research","Framework","Risk management"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rmf000000000004dsr a risk management framework for design science research","src":["itu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/58341210/Pries_Heje_etal_26_1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-038359","identifier":[{"id":"84906485836","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-a6b9c149-2bd9-4521-93a7-c913158edf6c","ruc-f95aca77-ce66-44e6-8f59-dbb5380248a1"],"keyword":["Risk management","design science research","framework"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-A65B3058C30668C63942543FBB922052"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://iris.cs.aau.dk/tl_files/volumes/volume26/Pries-Heje-etal-26-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/58341210/Pries_Heje_etal_26_1.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"au","key":"curtin university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Curtin University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"John","key":"venablepau","last":"Venable","name":"Venable, John","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Richard","key":"baskervillepau","last":"Baskerville","name":"Baskerville, Richard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09050167"],"issue":"1","journal":"Scandinavian Journal of Information Systems","pages":"57-82","publisher":"Aalborg Universitet","status":"p","title":"Scandinavian Journal of Information Systems","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84906485836"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-a6b9c149-2bd9-4521-93a7-c913158edf6c","ruc-f95aca77-ce66-44e6-8f59-dbb5380248a1"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"RMF4DSR : A Risk Management Framework for Design Science Research","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-038359","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Although social media research has accelerated dramatically in the last few years, few studies have addressed organizational use of social media as a process of institutionalization at industry level and over a longer time period. Against this backdrop, we present the findings from an industry level longitudinal study of the largest 100 Danish firms’ use of Facebook. To analyze our data, we draw on a multi stage model that emphasizes the differentiated and sequenced process of institutionalization: Habitualization, objectification and sedimentation. We find that data both indicates initiation of the first stages of institutionalization as well as it points to critical issues related to the progression of this process. The paper adds to the emerging literature on social media by an industry level longitudinal study of how organizational use of social media can be understood as a process of institutionalization.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Haahr, Lars","Svejvig, Per"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-191727"],"event":{"acronym":"IRIS","end":"2014-08-13","place":"Ringsted, dk","start":"2014-08-10","title":"Scandinavian Conference in Information Systems (SCIS 5 / IRIS 37)","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"institutionalization of social media in large danish firms an industry level longitudinal study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-191727","ids":["au-6d63e249-5834-4523-9bf4-31cdc00be41f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6980947DDE2794E2413F1ACC2D158375"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"haahrpau","last":"Haahr","locid":"e0ca185d-d58a-4e25-8cad-fafdfee3be26","name":"Haahr, Lars","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per","key":"svejvigpau","last":"Svejvig","locid":"40558617-c35b-464e-a0f6-7a2940494271","name":"Svejvig, Per","orcid":"0000-0002-8758-4031","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ahmad","key":"ghazawnehpedh","last":"Ghazawneh","name":"Ghazawneh, Ahmad","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jacob","key":"nørbjergpedh","last":"Nørbjerg","name":"Nørbjerg, Jacob","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepedh","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788773498767"],"series":"Proceedings of the IRIS Conference","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 37th Information Systems Research Seminar in Scandinavia (IRIS 37)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-6d63e249-5834-4523-9bf4-31cdc00be41f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Institutionalization of Social Media in Large Danish Firms : An Industry Level Longitudinal Study","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-191727","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"In this article we investigate how enterprise crowdsourcing can be used to change the innovation culture in a consultancy company by conducting an empirical investigation in a large engineering consultancy. The analysis shows that enterprise crowdsourcing has created a new and different awareness of innovation, empowered the employees, supported collaboration across different organizational units to a new extent thus contributing to small changes in the innovation culture of the organization.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Scupola, Ada","Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-120281"],"event":{"end":"2014-08-13","place":"Ringsted, dk","start":"2014-08-10","title":"5th Scandinavian Conference on Information Systems, SCIS 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Crowdsourcing","Innovation culture","Organizational culture","Social media"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the impact of enterprise crowdsourcing on company innovation culture the case of an engineering consultancy","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-120281","identifier":[{"id":"84927657366","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f18d9ae4-6bc7-47f6-8b70-8de52b444cc6"],"keyword":["Crowdsourcing","Innovation culture","Organizational culture","Social media"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-6-1F98BA53678476DF4123B2FB72965B6F"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","lo