{"abstract":"For 5 år siden startede to danske universiteter – Syddansk og Roskilde – hver en masteruddannelse i Projektledelse. Denne sommer er de begge blevet akkrediteret, dvs. at de har været igennem den offentlige kvalitetssikring, og de har begge bestået. Artiklen giver overblik over hvordan kvalitetssikringen foregår og hvad resultatet var.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Riis, Eva","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-609665"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"offentlig kvalitetssikring af masteruddannelser i projektledelse","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/89468424/MPL_Artikel_om_validering_Dansk_Projektledelse_01_2014.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-609665","ids":["sdu-7f7f5595-ecce-45bf-9cf3-c929861a42e9"],"keyword":["Akkreditering, aftagerpaneler","Masteruddannelse i projektledelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D0A4A2B886141B4F468D7F7D879AB218"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/89468424/MPL_Artikel_om_validering_Dansk_Projektledelse_01_2014.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Institut for Ledelse og Virksomhedsstrategi"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"