{"abstract":"When you have stable and non-ambiguous requirements then a classic contract for IS between a supplier and a public sector institution based on a requirements specification may be well suited. However, if you have to accept many changes or have ambiguous requirements then you may end up with “endless” re-negotiation of the requirements; you need a more flexible way to develop IS. A new way of coping with many changes is to use an agile development approach and a fixed budget and resources contract. This paper presents an example case. We analyse the case and design a guideline for how to implement a fixed budget and resources contract in the public sector. The guideline includes elements to cope with challenges in a tender process such as transparency, criteria for supplier selection, and live assessment of resource skills and capabilities, as well as achieving the flexibility for change needed.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Lene","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384841"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Design science research","Public sector","agile resource contract","tender process"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"designing a guideline for selecting a supplier for an agile fixed budget amp resource contract in the public sector","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-384841","ids":["itu-f31cd12f-7d0e-4e42-a66b-3a3a511ab9ec"],"keyword":["Design science research","Design science research, public sector, agile resource contract, tender process","agile resource contract","public sector","tender process"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0D0D1E1B668387B082491D155C47AC20"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice","The Department, Interdisciplinary Section"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"prieshejelenepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Lene","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"prieshejejanpau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["0001000X"],"issn_org":["00000036"],"issue":"27","journal":"Proceedings / Information Systems Research In Scandinavia","status":"p","title":"Proceedings / Information Systems Research In Scandinavia","title_org":"Proceedings / Information Systems Research In Scandinavia (IRIS)","volume":"2014"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-f31cd12f-7d0e-4e42-a66b-3a3a511ab9ec"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Designing a guideline for selecting a supplier for an agile fixed budget &amp; resource contract in the public sector","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384841","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
