{"abstract":"Design theory is often an outcome of Design Science Research (DSR) and kernel theories provide explanatory justification of design principles. But like an iceberg, many of the design principles lie hidden under the surface or inadequately specified. Ascertaining the completeness of the design principles requires additional design process steps to surface underlying assumptions and to abstract design principles which emerge during secondary design. We follow the development of a project management decision support artifact and describe the primary design, based on literature on agile systems development, and the subsequent secondary design that took place in a financial company. Analysis reveals an “iceberg phenomenon”; only a partial design justification was initially apparent, and underlying design assumptions are only revealed through deeper reflection and analysis. We conclude by providing guidelines for making design justification more explicit in both the design and the evaluation phases.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Hovorka, Dirk S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384523"],"event":{"acronym":"DESRIST","title":"Design Science Research in Information Systems and Technology"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Agile Systems Development","Design Justification","Design Science Research DSR","Design principles","Kernel Theories"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"don t ignore the iceberg timely revelation of justification in dsr","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84879827782","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384523","identifier":[{"id":"84879827782","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-ddbfce4d-9c25-4154-aa2c-00124fcad030"],"keyword":["Agile Systems Development","Design Justification","Design Principles","Design Science Research (DSR)","Kernel Theories"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-2CBBA5D6E660F5736F59BFD215D25E33"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dirk S.","key":"hovorkapau","last":"Hovorka","name":"Hovorka, Dirk S.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9783642388262"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"228-241","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"8th International Conference, DESRIST 2013, Helsinki, Finland, June 11‐12, 2013. Proceedings","title":"Design science at the intersection of physical and virtual design"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84879827782"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-ddbfce4d-9c25-4154-aa2c-00124fcad030"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Don't Ignore the Iceberg : Timely Revelation of Justification in DSR","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384523","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
