{"abstract":"This book is an attempt to gather current state-of-the-art research on project management from multiple universities and university colleges in Denmark. This chapter first discuss a literature review of Danish and Scandinavian research on project management thereby complementing the short review in chapter 1. Second the chapter undertake the risky adventure of pointing out future trends, using the chapters in this book as a stepping stone for doing that.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Harboe, Peter G.","Madsen, Sabine","Svejvig, Per"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-017657"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"current trends and future directions","src":["au","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.statsbiblioteket.dk/au/index.jsp?query=recordID:%22sb_5565173%22","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-017657","ids":["au-44ceab8c-6ee0-42f4-9f99-31c417c2c9f5","ruc-65809e44-5d42-48fc-9d39-d34132bfe753"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-EE030CCDF86C2D4667D483C4CEB65FC4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.statsbiblioteket.dk/au/index.jsp?query=recordID:%22sb_5565173%22","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","na