{"abstract":"En ny måde at bedrive projekter på breder sig i disse år med overraskende fart. Selv om de første tanker om ”Scrum” – hvor navnet og fremgangsmåden er inspireret af Rugby-spillet – blev tænkt for mere end 10 år siden, så er det først nu at fremgangsmåden for alvor har vundet udbredelse i Danmark. Denne artikel gennemgår metoden og fortæller om både positive resultater og udfordringer i tre danske organisationer: Et softwarehus, en bank, og et universitet. De tre cases illustrer meget forskellige anvendelsessituationer af Scrum set i forhold til projekternes størrelse, karakter og den organisatoriske kontekst. Artiklen slutter med at diskutere, hvad det er der gør, at Scrum er blevet så populær, og i dag fremstår som et reelt alternativ til klassisk plandreven projektledelse","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Lene","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-038269"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Agile project management","Case studies","Organizational context","Project management transition","Scrum methodology"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rugby metoden scrum en ny måde at bedrive projekter på","src":["itu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-100.00-038269","ids":["itu-1ed6a6d5-7879-4405-ac3a-965d39afdcec","ruc-a4f0549b-1e1d-4c78-bb17-cc1b53302d33"],"keyword":["Agile project management","Case studies","Organizational context","Project management transition","Scrum methodology"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-78B75F1830872D3883D3276BF581F4DB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice","The Department, Culture, Aesthetics, Organisations and Society"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"prieshejelenepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Lene","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejejanpau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09008322"],"issue":"5","journal":"Samfundslederskab i Skandinavien","pages":"583-602","publisher":"DenOffentlige","status":"p","title":"Samfundslederskab i Skandinavien","volume":"2011/2012"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-1ed6a6d5-7879-4405-ac3a-965d39afdcec","ruc-a4f0549b-1e1d-4c78-bb17-cc1b53302d33"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Rugby-metoden SCRUM: En ny måde at bedrive projekter på","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-038269","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Blogging has often been described as writing an online diary but, nowadays, it is more diverse and a considerable amount of blogs forms a common interconnected resource – the blogosphere – with comprehensive societal impact. While various studies have inquired social-psychological influences on the intention to contribute to an individual blog, the perceptions related to creating such a common valuable good have not yet been focussed. Therefore, we introduce a new construct – the oeuvre of blogging – to better account for the notion of the blogosphere as a collective outcome. Furthermore, we propose a research model to inquire the influence of individual and collective beliefs on the oeuvre in comparison to short-term blogging activity. We conducted an online survey with 509 international distributed bloggers to test our model. The results of our study provide support for the importance of an oeuvre construct to explain influences on bloggers and blogging","author_count":8,"contributors":["Kalb, Hendrik","Trier, Matthias"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-297688"],"event":{"end":"2012-06-13","place":"Barcelona, es","start":"2012-06-10","title":"20th European Conference on Information Systems, ECIS 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Technische Universität Berlin"],"keyword":["Blog","Blogosphere","Knowledge sharing","PLS"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the blogosphere as oeuvre individual and collective influence on bloggers","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://aisel.aisnet.org/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1109&context=ecis2012","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-297688","identifier":[{"id":"84905734787","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-ea27da07-20a0-48cf-a737-d51c983f7299"],"keyword":["Blog","Blogosphere","Collective benefit","Knowledge sharing","PLS"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B9C8C0AF6D0A9D3B7E5B91B5A18304E8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"technische universität berlin","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Technische Universität Berlin","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of IT Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hendrik","key":"kalbpau","last":"Kalb","name":"Kalb, Hendrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Matthias","key":"trierpau","last":"Trier","locid":"d73eb972-e715-444d-93b3-a6cd6cd3b0dc","name":"Trier, Matthias","orcid":"0000-0002-8758-2968","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepedh","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mike","key":"chiassonpedh","last":"Chiasson","name":"Chiasson, Mike","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jonathan","key":"warehampedh","last":"Wareham","name":"Wareham, Jonathan","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Xavier","key":"busquetspedh","last":"Busquets","name":"Busquets, Xavier","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Josep","key":"valorpedh","last":"Valor","name":"Valor, Josep","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sandra","key":"seiberpedh","last":"Seiber","name":"Seiber, Sandra","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788488971548"],"issn":["00000034"],"place":"Atlanta, GA","publisher":"Association for Information Systems. AIS Electronic Library (AISeL)","series":"Proceedings of the European Conference on Information Systems","status":"p","title":"ECIS 2012 Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-ea27da07-20a0-48cf-a737-d51c983f7299"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"The Blogosphere as Oeuvre : Individual and Collective Influence on Bloggers","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-297688","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
