{"abstract":"Many companies consider and some undertake outsourcing of their software development activities. Often, information systems development is outsourced to vendors in different cultures or with a different level of software-process maturity. Recommendations for managing such offshore outsourcing arrangements typically involve more interaction between the client and the vendor to understand each other’s culture better, improve communication, form partnerships and the like. We have studied a client that did the opposite. On the basis of a case study, we describe how the interaction between the client and the vendor was minimized on purpose. What mechanisms were used? What worked and what did not? We conclude that minimizing interaction can be a viable strategy to follow when clients face large cultural and maturity inequality in offshoring their software development activities but that the strategy also has important limitations.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Hertzum, Morten","Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-559839"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Culture","Extra costs","Maturity","Minimal interaction strategy","Offshore outsourcing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"is minimizing interaction a solution to cultural and maturity inequality in offshore outsourcing","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-559839","ids":["ruc-39727990-9778-44cb-b8db-a0a0b23f4934"],"keyword":["Culture","Extra costs","Maturity","Minimal-interaction strategy","Offshore outsourcing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-852C0036BA2FCB5201B44938BA8B47E0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"hertzumpau","last":"Hertzum","locid":"cd5a2f82-1658-4e03-8e6b-63bc1215e394","name":"Hertzum, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-0019-8531","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"hertzumpedh","last":"Hertzum","name":"Hertzum, Morten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"jørgensenpedh","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788251927581"],"pages":"77-97","place":"Trondheim, NO","publisher":"TAPIR Akademisk Forlag","status":"p","title":"Balancing Sourcing and Innovation in Information Systems Development"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-39727990-9778-44cb-b8db-a0a0b23f4934"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Is Minimizing Interaction a Solution to Cultural and Maturity Inequality in Offshore Outsourcing?","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-559839","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
