earch In Scandinavia","title_org":"Proceedings / Information Systems Research In Scandinavia (IRIS)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-4b0f2090-b9a0-48e2-ac0b-8e35c64f75b9"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"The Six-C model for IS project teambuilding","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560990","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Scrum has gained surprising momentum as an agile IS project management approach. An obvious question is why Scrum is so useful? To answer that question we carried out a longitudinal study of a distributed project using Scrum. We analyzed the data using coding and categorisation and three carefully selected theoretical frameworks. Our conclusion in this paper is that Scrum is so useful because it provides effective communication in the form of boundary objects and boundary spanners, it provides effective social integration by building up social team capital, and it provides much needed control and coordination mechanisms by allowing both local and global articulation of work in the project. That is why Scrum is especially useful for distributed IS project management and teamwork.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Pries-Heje, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-562470"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Agile","Boundary objects","Distributed","Project management","Scrum","Social capital","Teamwork","Virtual"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"agile amp distributed project management a case study revealing why scrum is useful","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-562470","ids":["ruc-618bb5ec-476b-4340-986d-2a2bbf52983e"],"keyword":["Virtual","agile","articulation theory","boundary objects","distributed","project management","scrum","social capital","teamwork"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0271A65F58378B8E04CE2DDE44000F1B"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejejanpau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lene","key":"prieshejelenepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Lene","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00000034"],"journal":"Proceedings / European Conference on Information Systems","status":"p","title":"Proceedings / European Conference on Information Systems","title_org":"Proceedings of the European Conference on Information Systems","volume":"2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-618bb5ec-476b-4340-986d-2a2bbf52983e"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Agile &amp; Distributed Project Management : A Case Study revealing why SCRUM is useful","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-562470","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Styrken ved agil projektledelse er hurtigheden og muligheden for at absorbere ændringer hurtigt gennem hele projektets løbetid, men der er naturligvis også nogle svagheder. Nogle af dem nævner jeg i artiklen, men derudover egner agil-formen sig ikke specielt godt til komplicerede projekter, hvor liv eller mange penge er på spil. Agil-formen er heller ikke velegnet til umotiverede medarbejdere, fordi de ikke har noget at bidrage med. For en projektleder synes jeg, at det er væsentligt at have et dybdegående kendskab til positive og negative sider ved både agil og plandreven projektledelse. Verden er kompleks, og vores projekter derfor er tilsvarende komplekse. Som projektleder bør man således kunne analysere sig frem til den rigtige form for projektledelse, uanset om det er agil projektledelse eller ej.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-565185"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hvornår er agil projektledelse rigtig","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","text":"Undefined","type":"url","url":"http://www.mannaz.com/da/artikler/agil-projektledelse","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-565185","ids":["ruc-8898885b-2584-46e4-b14d-54e6af4c1b23"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F0EABDB99B0EEBA148F2F395604FAF69"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["ruc-8898885b-2584-46e4-b14d-54e6af4c1b23"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Hvornår er agil projektledelse rigtig?","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-565185","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
